msgctxt "Bat"
msgid "Bat can jump endlessly in the air but it cannot infect humans."
msgstr "Целта за инфектираните е да заразят всички хора."

#: src/game/server/infclass/ic_gamecontroller.cpp:7197
msgctxt "Bat"
msgid "Instead, it can hammer humans to steal their health and heal itself."
msgstr ""

#: src/game/server/infclass/ic_gamecontroller.cpp:7198
msgctxt "Bat"
msgid "The hammer is also useful for healing the infected."
msgstr ""

#: src/game/server/infclass/ic_gamecontroller.cpp:7199
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "Bat"
msgid "It can also inflict 1 damage point per second by hooking humans."
msgstr ""
"Също така, той може да нанесе 1 точка повреда за секунда като използва "
"своята кука върху хора."

#: src/game/server/infclass/ic_gamecontroller.cpp:7202
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "Ghost"
msgid ""
"The Ghost is invisible until a human comes nearby, it takes damage, or it "
"uses the hammer."
msgstr ""
"Той е невидим, освен ако някой човек не е близо до него, ако бъде ударен, "
"или ако използва своя чук."

#: src/game/server/infclass/ic_gamecontroller.cpp:7204
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "Ghost"
msgid "It can infect humans and heal the infected with the hammer."
