"Също така, той може да нанесе 1 точка повреда за секунда като използва "
"своята кука върху хора."

#: src/game/server/infclass/ic_gamecontroller.cpp:7208
msgctxt "Spider"
msgid ""
"The Spider has a web hook that automatically grabs any human touching it."
msgstr ""

#: src/game/server/infclass/ic_gamecontroller.cpp:7209
msgctxt "Spider"
msgid "The web hook mode can be toggled by switching the weapon."
msgstr ""

#: src/game/server/infclass/ic_gamecontroller.cpp:7210
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "Spider"
msgid ""
"In both modes the hook inflicts 1 damage point per second and can grab a "
"human for longer."
